  "description": "Introducing the UrbanGlide - Ultra Electric Assist Bicycle\nExplore the city in style with the UrbanGlide Electric Assist Bicycle. Available in Gunmetal Blue/Lava Red, this sleek and dynamic bike offers a perfect blend of performance and aesthetics.\nKey Features:\n\nSize Options: Choose between S and L sizes for a personalized and comfortable riding experience.\n\nEffortless Pedal-Assist: Enjoy a smooth and effortless ride with the advanced Pedal-Assist system.\n\nPowerful 500W Motor: The bike is equipped with a robust 500W motor, providing powerful support for your rides.\n\nLong-Lasting Battery: With a 48V 15Ah, 690Wh battery, the UrbanGlide - Ultra ensures a durable and long-lasting power supply for your journeys.\n\nImpressive Speed: Reach a maximum speed of 20mph, ensuring a thrilling and efficient ride.\n\nExtended Range: Experience freedom with a range of 65-70 miles on a single charge, perfect for long-distance rides.\n\nSturdy Build: Weighing at 32kg, the bike offers a solid and stable foundation for your urban adventures.\n\nSafety Certified: Complies with UL 2849 and CPSC | 16-CFR-2015 standards, ensuring the utmost safety and reliability.\n\nElevate your commuting experience with the UrbanGlide - Ultra. Whether you're navigating city streets or exploring scenic routes, this electric assist bicycle combines style, performance, and safety for an unparalleled riding experience.",
